This repository adapts the Qualitative Research Analysis System by Urs Chalupny
(https://github.com/Theurrien/qualitative-research-analysis), which its author
provides "as-is for research and educational purposes" and asks users to cite,
to describe the methodology transparently in their methods section, and to
follow their institution's guidelines for AI-assisted research. Those terms
continue to apply to the parts taken from the original; the MIT License above
covers this adaptation.
